er-separator\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-icon elementor-divider__element\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-university\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M496 128v16a8 8 0 0 1-8 8h-24v12c0 6.627-5.373 12-12 12H60c-6.627 0-12-5.373-12-12v-12H24a8 8 0 0 1-8-8v-16a8 8 0 0 1 4.941-7.392l232-88a7.996 7.996 0 0 1 6.118 0l232 88A8 8 0 0 1 496 128zm-24 304H40c-13.255 0-24 10.745-24 24v16a8 8 0 0 0 8 8h464a8 8 0 0 0 8-8v-16c0-13.255-10.745-24-24-24zM96 192v192H60c-6.627 0-12 5.373-12 12v20h416v-20c0-6.627-5.373-12-12-12h-36V192h-64v192h-64V192h-64v192h-64V192H96z\"><\/path><\/svg><\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-3092db3 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"3092db3\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>CamTech was founded to enhance and accelerate the economic growth opportunities for Cambodian people.<br \/>Focusing on prosperous future based on equal opportunities and inclusivity.<br \/>CamTech is a <em>rising sta<\/em>r high education institution that aim to disrupt the existing education standards, <br \/>bringing world class innovation and knowledge in the country at the right time <br \/>and providing the right environment to talented Cambodians of any age and international students.<br \/>That\u2019s why we love to say that are the Cambodian University with the biggest <em>reason why. <\/em><em><br \/><\/em>You can understand better and deeper by discovering here below, what our Chairmen has to tell say&#8230;<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-cf05747 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"cf05747\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Why CamTech is here to make history<\/h2>\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-7f0e118 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"7f0e118\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px; text-align: center; white-space-collapse: collapse;\">Neak Oknha Dr. Pung Kheav Se<\/span><\/h2>\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-36d51e8 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"36d51e8\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h6 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\"><span style=\"color: var( --e-global-color-text ); font-family: var( --e-global-typography-text-font-family ), Sans-serif; font-weight: var( --e-global-typography-text-font-weight ); font-size: 17px; letter-spacing: 0em;\">Chairman of the Board of Trustees<\/span><br><\/h6>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-8749be9 elementor-hidden-desktop elementor-hidden-tablet elementor-hidden-phone elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-gap-beside-yes elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-column-vertical-align-stretch\" data-id=\"8749be9\" data-element_type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-extended\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-33 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-058ccab\" data-id=\"058ccab\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-85eebe3 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"85eebe3\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"523\" height=\"774\" src=\"https:\/\/camtech.edu.kh\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/07\/Pung-Kheav-Se_message.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-9735\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/camtech.edu.kh\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/07\/Pung-Kheav-Se_message.jpg 523w, https:\/\/camtech.edu.kh\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/07\/Pung-Kheav-Se_message-203x300.jpg 203w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 523px) 100vw, 523px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-66 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-313e8b9\" data-id=\"313e8b9\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-99c220b elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"99c220b\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<ul><li>Cambodia\u2019s economy is moving quickly and now more than ever local education system needs to develop and support the growth of local talents in fields of modern technologies, science. engineering, social sciences, arts and <br \/>Understanding these urgent needs, CamTech is here to lead the enhancement of the most demanded technical disciplines, providing students, adults and busines professional with the best of academics, certified professional courses and workshops.<\/li><li>CamTech knows that, according to a recent study, students learning science and technology related fields are only account for 20% of all university students in Cambodia while those studying fields like languages, banking and finance, accounting, hospitality are around the 73%. <br \/>Realistically the market demand of data analysts, data scientists, media and marketing specialists, robot automation technicians, AI solutions, machine learning tools is increasing day by day, while the most of other sectors are living one of the biggest world crisis from which we will not recover so fast.<\/li><li>CamTech is aware, looking at the countries in our economic region, that Cambodia has to hurry up to reach the same level of civil and economic development.<br \/>In particular CamTech wants to give equal opportunities to talented Cambodians inspiring, motivating, supporting and training them to become active players to reach the prosperous future that the country deserve.<\/li><\/ul>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-397722e elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-gap-beside-yes elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-column-vertical-align-stretch\" data-id=\"397722e\" data-element_type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-extended\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-33 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-c7f022b\" data-id=\"c7f022b\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-0c266b5 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"0c266b5\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https:\/\/camtech.edu.kh\/pung-kheav-se\/\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img decoding=\"async\" width=\"640\" height=\"428\" src=\"https:\/\/camtech.edu.kh\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/12\/Dr.-Pung-Kheav-Se-Picture-1024x684.jpg\" class=\"elementor-animation-wobble-vertical attachment-large size-large wp-image-32532\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/camtech.edu.kh\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/12\/Dr.-Pung-Kheav-Se-Picture-1024x684.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/camtech.edu.kh\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/12\/Dr.-Pung-Kheav-Se-Picture-300x200.jpg 300w, https:\/\/camtech.edu.kh\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/12\/Dr.-Pung-Kheav-Se-Picture-768x513.jpg 768w, https:\/\/camtech.edu.kh\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/12\/Dr.-Pung-Kheav-Se-Picture-1536x1026.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/camtech.edu.kh\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/12\/Dr.-Pung-Kheav-Se-Picture-2048x1368.jpg 2048w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) 100vw, 640px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-66 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-e6bf020\" data-id=\"e6bf020\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-a765750 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"a765750\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-c863c5c elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"c863c5c\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">As Cambodia\u2019s economy continues to grow rapidly, our education system must evolve to support the development of local talent in critical fields such as modern technology, science, engineering, social sciences, and the arts. Recognizing this urgent need, CamTech University is committed to leading the way in building the most in-demand technical and professional skills. Recent studies show that only 30% of Cambodian university students are enrolled in science and technology programs, while the remaining 70% focus on non-STEM fields, including languages, banking, finance, accounting, and hospitality. Meanwhile, the demand for professionals skilled in data analysis, data science, robotics, automation, AI, and machine learning grows every day.<\/span><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-cb0e165 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"cb0e165\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-28cddd5 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"28cddd5\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">At CamTech, we aim to change the traditional mindset that Cambodia must rely on foreign experts for specialized solutions. While we recognize the value of cultural exchange and shared expertise, our priority is to empower and elevate local talent to meet international standards. Our mission is to provide world-class education and training for learners at every stage, from university students to adults who want to acquire high-demand skills to business professionals looking to enhance their expertise. Through partnerships with universities worldwide and hands-on internships with leading local and regional companies, CamTech equips students with practical experience that often leads to career opportunities.<\/span><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-1ee954f e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"1ee954f\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-774a2ff elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"774a2ff\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">We are dedicated to supporting each student on their journey toward a meaningful career, whether in employment, entrepreneurship, or advanced studies. Together, let us build a future where Cambodian talent is recognized and celebrated on a global stage.<\/span><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-ff5e750 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-gap-beside-yes elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-column-vertical-align-stretch\" data-id=\"ff5e750\" data-element_type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-extended\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-4ee3175\" data-id=\"4ee3175\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4dcf41f elementor-widget elementor-widget-spacer\" data-id=\"4dcf41f\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"spacer.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-spacer\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-spacer-inner\"><\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Message from the Chairman CamTech was founded to enhance and accelerate the economic growth opportunities for Cambodian people.Focusing on prosperous future based on equal opportunities and inclusivity.CamTech is a rising star high education institution that aim to disrupt the existing education standards, bringing world class innovation and knowledge in the country at the right time and providing the right environment to talented Cambodians of any age and international students.That\u2019s why we love to say that are the Cambodian University with the biggest reason why. You can understand better and deeper by discovering here below, what our Chairmen has to tell say&#8230; Why CamTech is here to make history Neak Oknha Dr. Pung Kheav Se Chairman of the Board of Trustees Cambodia\u2019s economy is moving quickly and now more than ever local education system needs to develop and support the growth of local talents in fields of modern technologies, science. engineering, social sciences, arts and Understanding these urgent needs, CamTech is here to lead the enhancement of the most demanded technical disciplines, providing students, adults and busines professional with the best of academics, certified professional courses and workshops. CamTech knows that, according to a recent study, students learning science and technology related fields are only account for 20% of all university students in Cambodia while those studying fields like languages, banking and finance, accounting, hospitality are around the 73%. Realistically the market demand of data analysts, data scientists, media and marketing specialists, robot automation technicians, AI solutions, machine learning tools is increasing day by day, while the most of other sectors are living one of the biggest world crisis from which we will not recover so fast. CamTech is aware, looking at the countries in our economic region, that Cambodia has to hurry up to reach the same level of civil and economic development.In particular CamTech wants to give equal opportunities to talented Cambodians inspiring, motivating, supporting and training them to become active players to reach the prosperous future that the country deserve. As Cambodia\u2019s economy continues to grow rapidly, our education system must evolve to support the development of local talent in critical fields such as modern technology, science, engineering, social sciences, and the arts. Recognizing this urgent need, CamTech University is committed to leading the way in building the most in-demand technical and professional skills. Recent studies show that only 30% of Cambodian university students are enrolled in science and technology programs, while the remaining 70% focus on non-STEM fields, including languages, banking, finance, accounting, and hospitality. Meanwhile, the demand for professionals skilled in data analysis, data science, robotics, automation, AI, and machine learning grows every day. At CamTech, we aim to change the traditional mindset that Cambodia must rely on foreign experts for specialized solutions. While we recognize the value of cultural exchange and shared expertise, our priority is to empower and elevate local talent to meet international standards. Our mission is to provide world-class education and training for learners at every stage, from university students to adults who want to acquire high-demand skills to business professionals looking to enhance their expertise. Through partnerships with universities worldwide and hands-on internships with leading local and regional companies, CamTech equips students with practical experience that often leads to career opportunities. We are dedicated to supporting each student on their journey toward a meaningful career, whether in employment, entrepreneurship, or advanced studies. Together, let us build a future where Cambodian talent is recognized and celebrated on a global stage.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":2,"featured_media":0,"parent":0,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false,"footnotes":""},"class_list":["post-9728","page","type-page","status-publish","hentry","post-no-thumbnail"],"acf":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/camtech.edu.kh\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/9728","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/camtech.edu.kh\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/camtech.edu.kh\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/page"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/camtech.edu.kh\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/2"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/camtech.edu.kh\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=9728"}],"version-history":[{"count":5,"href":"https:\/\/camtech.edu.kh\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/9728\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":36142,"href":"https:\/\/camtech.edu.kh\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/9728\/revisions\/36142"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/camtech.edu.kh\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=9728"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}}